Package: FusAphidMOFA
Type: Project
Title: MOFA Analysis for Fusarium-Aphid Multi-Omics Study
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Publication", family = "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Standalone R project containing the source code, input workbook,
